      "message": "wallet: Move derivehdkey HD key selection into CWallet\n\nMove HD key selection from the derivehdkey RPC into CWallet::SelectHDKey(),\nand make the RPC call the wallet method.\n\nThe wallet method returns a `util::Result<CExtKey>`, carrying the selected\nextended private key on success and a translated error message on failure.\nThe RPC continues to enforce the watch-only and unlocked-wallet\npreconditions, validates the derivation path, and maps any wallet error to\nRPC_INVALID_ADDRESS_OR_KEY.",
