      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 0124775fdf6303f4812e1afdcab8493f644ddd32\nparent 11953500e91920bc6357190bcd8956212913743d\nauthor PraneethGunas <praneethgunas404@gmail.com> 1787591871 -0700\ncommitter PraneethGunas <praneethgunas404@gmail.com> 1787592085 -0700\n\nwallet: Return WalletError from SelectHDKey\n\nChange CWallet::SelectHDKey() to return a `util::Expected<CExtKey,\nWalletError>` and distinguish the locked-wallet case with a dedicated\n`UnlockNeeded` code, so non-RPC callers can react to it programmatically.\nThe derivehdkey RPC maps `UnlockNeeded` to RPC_WALLET_UNLOCK_NEEDED and any\nother error to RPC_INVALID_ADDRESS_OR_KEY.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRfqDW/pLSFogdaX281yQTY7xFXMAUCaox9lRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQNckE2O8RVzBUtQD/YoVwuCsVGk0hlZC4PYuK\n6hipoq/M+jWy8RdluQtKZfEBAIAAQ3n+lKcMCFlIpUU+/LLStdg0lvxGJO942CqG\nJ6sI\n=Ggc9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
